        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-21T02:12:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just wanted to emphasize one of the rules your brought up. RULW: All cash is counted at the beginning of the Requisition phase. You emphasized that you can use a card AFTER it is counted and still get it money. This is all true (thanks Ronway). One of issue you have to consider is whether or not to use the Boost BEFORE the Requisition phase. If you do, you don't get its cash value.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:36:42.498Z",
