        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-21T02:25:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Correct. In fact it wouldn't even be possible to use it during the Req phase before you get money (that happens first). There are, however, many Boosts taht don;t have phase limitations. It is with those you have to make a decision.</p><p>So why would you even want to use it before the Req phase? Becuase you can use them BEFORE you travel during the Travel phase. Thereby, causing an effect in the Sector you are coming from.</p>",
